Every enumerator is exported as a constant sub.

=head2 SDL_BlendOperation

The blend operation used when combining source and destination pixel components.

=over

=item SDL_BLENDOPERATION_ADD = 1 - dst + src: supported by all renderers

=item SDL_BLENDOPERATION_SUBTRACT = 2 - src - dst : supported by D3D, OpenGL, OpenGLES, and Vulkan

=item SDL_BLENDOPERATION_REV_SUBTRACT = 3 - dst - src : supported by D3D, OpenGL, OpenGLES, and Vulkan

=item SDL_BLENDOPERATION_MINIMUM = 4 - min(dst, src) : supported by D3D, OpenGL, OpenGLES, and Vulkan

=item SDL_BLENDOPERATION_MAXIMUM = 5 - max(dst, src) : supported by D3D, OpenGL, OpenGLES, and Vulkan

=back

